Visualization and structural analysis
The OVITO package91 allowed us to visualize and analyze selected AIMD and ML-MD trajectories. In particular, we looked at (i) Radial pair distribution functions (with a cut-off radius of 5.5 Å), (ii) Elastic strain maps and (iii) Atomic strain maps (with cut-off radius of ± 0.1 Å). For details see the OVITO documentation.
